  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pre-pilot for Business in Development Facility - Pilot for Business in Developm</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">uppstartsfas f&#xf6;r uppr&#xe4;ttande av en facilitet f&#xf6;r  partnerskapsbyggande mellan privata, civila och   statliga akt&#xf6;rer</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International Business Leaders forum har, inom ramen f&#xf6;r Busan Building Block on Pulic Private Cooperation gjort en studie om behovet av att s&#xe4;tta upp en facilitet f&#xf6;r underl&#xe4;ttande av partnerskap mellan staten, f&#xf6;retag, civila samh&#xe4;llet eller givare. Studien visade p&#xe5; intresse och IBLF g&#xe5;r vidare med en pilotfas p&#xe5; en s&#xe5;dan facilitet genom att b&#xf6;rja med n&#xe5;gra partnerskap.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Business Leaders forum has, within the context of the Busan Building Block on Public Private Cooperation, carried out a scoping study on the need for a Business and Development Facility to broker partnerships between government, civil society, cooperating partners and private sector actors. The scoping found interest in such a facility and IBLF is proceeding with a pilot phase.</narrative>
  </description>
